{"id":"4b1dae83-5673-4e0b-aac6-bd5447fc903d","createdAt":"2026-10-26T14:44:46.440Z","batchId":"states_gpt-6-luna_high","approach":"html","modelId":"gpt-6-luna","settings":{"effort":"high"},"presetId":"states","prompt":"Two states for a file list: an empty state with an upload call to action, and an error state with a retry button.","system":"Return only the body content of an HTML page: no doctype, <html>, <head> or <body> tags, no markdown, no code fences, no prose. The page shell below is already loaded, so build with its classes and chart helper. Inline <script> is allowed for interactivity (tabs, toggles, filters); no external requests. Add a small <style> block only for what the classes cannot express, or when the request asks for a different look, colours, fonts or layout: then follow the request.\nPAGE SHELL (already loaded; do not restate it):\n- A stylesheet with these classes. Use them instead of writing CSS:\n  layout: page (centered column), stack, row, between, center, gap-sm, gap-lg, grid + cols-2|cols-3|cols-4 (responsive)\n  surfaces: card, card-title, card-desc, alert, alert-destructive, hr\n  text: h1-h4 (styled), lead, muted, small, up, down (trend colours)\n  controls: btn, btn-secondary|btn-outline|btn-ghost|btn-destructive, btn-sm|btn-lg, btn-block; label wraps input/select/textarea; label.check wraps a checkbox or radio\n  data: table (styled; td.num for numbers), badge, badge-secondary|badge-outline|badge-destructive, stat-label, stat-value, progress (inner div with style=\"width:NN%\"), avatar\n- Charts: <div data-chart='{\"type\":\"bar|line|area|pie\",\"title\":\"…\",\"data\":[{\"label\":\"W1\",\"value\":120}]}'></div> renders an SVG chart (single series, pie gets a legend). Do not draw charts yourself.\n- Light and dark mode are handled by the stylesheet.\n\nDESIGN BRIEF (applies to every UI you produce):\n- Build a complete, realistic screen, not a skeleton: a clear title and intro, grouped sections, and enough detail that it could ship.\n- Cover exactly what the request names, with no extra pages or marketing sections.\n- Use the supplied DATA in full: every field is there to be shown. Derive useful extras from it (shares, totals, deltas, rankings) instead of inventing unrelated numbers.\n- Where it fits, add status badges, trend/change figures, secondary actions, helper text, and sensible empty or edge-case copy.\n- Establish hierarchy with headings, size and weight; group related items; keep spacing and alignment consistent.\n- Make charts readable: a title, labelled axes or values, and a legend for pie charts.\n- Never use lorem ipsum or placeholder names like \"Item 1\".","systemHash":"0c16911c9564c3db3ada7a622931ee6ffc820ebf9a373996782a9f1f0fc3c98c","systemOverridden":false,"strictOutput":false,"rawOutput":"<style>\n  [hidden] { display: none !important; }\n  .file-state {\n    min-height: 340px;\n    display: grid;\n    place-items: center;\n    padding: 2rem 1rem;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n  .file-state-content { max-width: 28rem; }\n  .file-state-icon {\n    width: 3.5rem;\n    height: 3.5rem;\n    display: grid;\n    place-items: center;\n    margin: 0 auto 1rem;\n    border: 1px solid currentColor;\n    border-radius: 999px;\n    opacity: .75;\n  }\n  .file-state-icon svg { width: 1.75rem; height: 1.75rem; }\n  .state-tabs { display: flex; gap: .5rem; }\n  .file-actions { margin-top: 1.25rem; }\n</style>\n\n<main class=\"page stack gap-lg\">\n  <header class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n    <p class=\"small muted\">Workspace <span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span> Files</p>\n    <h1 class=\"h1\">Files</h1>\n    <p class=\"lead\">Manage the files attached to this workspace.</p>\n  </header>\n\n  <section class=\"card stack gap-lg\" aria-labelledby=\"file-list-title\">\n    <div class=\"between row gap-lg\">\n      <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n        <h2 class=\"card-title\" id=\"file-list-title\">Your files</h2>\n        <p class=\"card-desc\">Files added to this workspace will appear here.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n        <span class=\"stat-label\">Preview state</span>\n        <div class=\"state-tabs\" role=\"tablist\" aria-label=\"File list state\">\n          <button class=\"btn btn-sm btn-secondary\" type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"empty-tab\" aria-controls=\"empty-panel\" aria-selected=\"true\">Empty</button>\n          <button class=\"btn btn-sm btn-outline\" type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"error-tab\" aria-controls=\"error-panel\" aria-selected=\"false\" tabindex=\"-1\">Error</button>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <hr>\n\n    <div class=\"file-state\" id=\"empty-panel\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"empty-tab\">\n      <div class=\"file-state-content stack gap-sm\">\n        <div class=\"file-state-icon muted\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\">\n            <path d=\"M3.5 7.5h6l2 2h9v8.8a1.7 1.7 0 0 1-1.7 1.7H5.2a1.7 1.7 0 0 1-1.7-1.7z\"/>\n            <path d=\"M3.5 7.5V5.7A1.7 1.7 0 0 1 5.2 4h4.3l2 2h4\"/>\n            <path d=\"M12 12v5m-2.5-2.5h5\"/>\n          </svg>\n        </div>\n        <h3 class=\"h3\">No files yet</h3>\n        <p class=\"muted\">Upload a file to get started. Your files will be available to everyone with access to this workspace.</p>\n        <div class=\"file-actions\">\n          <input id=\"file-picker\" type=\"file\" multiple hidden>\n          <button class=\"btn\" type=\"button\" id=\"upload-button\">Upload files</button>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"small muted\" id=\"upload-status\" aria-live=\"polite\">Choose files from your device to add them here.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"file-state\" id=\"error-panel\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"error-tab\" hidden>\n      <div class=\"file-state-content stack gap-sm\">\n        <div class=\"file-state-icon down\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\">\n            <circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\"/>\n            <path d=\"M12 7.5v5m0 3.5h.01\"/>\n          </svg>\n        </div>\n        <h3 class=\"h3\">We couldn’t load your files</h3>\n        <p class=\"muted\">There was a problem loading this file list. Please try again.</p>\n        <div class=\"file-actions\">\n          <button class=\"btn btn-secondary\" type=\"button\" id=\"retry-button\">\n            <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↻</span> Retry\n          </button>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"small muted\" id=\"retry-status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n</main>\n\n<script>\n  (() => {\n    const tabs = [\n      { button: document.getElementById('empty-tab'), panel: document.getElementById('empty-panel') },\n      { button: document.getElementById('error-tab'), panel: document.getElementById('error-panel') }\n    ];\n\n    function activateTab(index) {\n      tabs.forEach((tab, i) => {\n        const active = i === index;\n        tab.button.setAttribute('aria-selected', String(active));\n        tab.button.tabIndex = active ? 0 : -1;\n        tab.button.classList.toggle('btn-secondary', active);\n        tab.button.classList.toggle('btn-outline', !active);\n        tab.panel.hidden = !active;\n      });\n      tabs[index].button.focus();\n    }\n\n    tabs.forEach((tab, index) => {\n      tab.button.addEventListener('click', () => activateTab(index));\n      tab.button.addEventListener('keydown', event => {\n        if (event.key === 'ArrowRight' || event.key === 'ArrowLeft') {\n          event.preventDefault();\n          activateTab((index + (event.key === 'ArrowRight' ? 1 : tabs.length - 1)) % tabs.length);\n        }\n      });\n    });\n\n    const picker = document.getElementById('file-picker');\n    document.getElementById('upload-button').addEventListener('click', () => picker.click());\n    picker.addEventListener('change', () => {\n      const count = picker.files.length;\n      document.getElementById('upload-status').textContent = count\n        ? `${count} ${count === 1 ? 'file' : 'files'} selected.`\n        : 'Choose files from your device to add them here.';\n    });\n\n    const retryButton = document.getElementById('retry-button');\n    const retryStatus = document.getElementById('retry-status');\n    retryButton.addEventListener('click', () => {\n      retryButton.disabled = true;\n      retryButton.textContent = 'Retrying…';\n      retryStatus.textContent = 'Checking for files…';\n      window.setTimeout(() => {\n        retryButton.disabled = false;\n        retryButton.textContent = '↻ Retry';\n        retryStatus.textContent = 'The file list is still unavailable. Please try again.';\n      }, 800);\n    });\n  })();\n</script>","deltas":[[38774,"<style"],[38776,">\n"],[38780," "],[38784," ["],[38789,"hidden"],[38793,"]"],[38800," {"],[38804," display"],[38810,":"],[38816," none"],[38822," !"],[38824,"important"],[38830,";"],[38835," }\n"],[38839," "],[38842," ."],[38845,"file"],[38852,"-state"],[38864," {\n"],[38871,"   "],[38878," min"],[38884,"-height"],[38891,":"],[38900," "],[38909,"340"],[38931,"px"],[38932,";\n"],[38933,"   "],[38933," display"],[38940,":"],[38940," grid"],[38941,";\n"],[38954,"   "],[38956," place"],[38967,"-items"],[38967,":"],[38986," center"],[38986,";\n"],[38986,"   "],[38986," padding"],[38986,":"],[38991," "],[38998,"2"],[39002,"rem"],[39006," "],[39010,"1"],[39016,"rem"],[39028,";\n"],[39034,"   "],[39040," text"],[39046,"-align"],[39050,":"],[39053," center"],[39057,";\n"],[39061," "],[39067," }\n"],[39072," "],[39077," ."],[39089,"file"],[39090,"-state"],[39092,"-content"],[39098," {"],[39101," max"],[39109,"-width"],[39111,":"],[39115," "],[39119,"28"],[39129,"rem"],[39136,";"],[39147," }\n"],[39153," "],[39155," ."],[39164,"file"],[39174,"-state"],[39174,"-icon"],[39185," 